      "writtenOn": "2022-04-07T20:04:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My preference is to hold off on adding `cros_system_pin_voltage()` until it is actually needed.\n\nThe entire cros_system driver will get refactored at some point, so adding extra API calls now just in case likely just makes more work later.",
      "parentUuid": "e193f393_f48fe42e",
